      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "def Del(n,m):\n  return n % m == 0\n\nfor A in range(1, 1000):\n  ok = True\n  for x in range(1, 10000):\n    if ( Del(x,A) or (not Del(x,12)) or (not Del (x,14)) ) == 0:\n      ok = False\n  if ok:\n    print(A)",
      "originalText": "def Del(n,m):\n  return n % m == 0\n\nfor A in range(1, 1000):\n  ok = True\n  for x in range(1, 10000):\n    if ( Del(x,A) or (not Del(x,12)) or (not Del (x,14)) ) == 0:\n      ok = False\n  if ok:\n    print(A)",
