      "text": "for A in range(0, 1000):\n  ok = True\n  for x in range(0, 10000):\n    if ((x & 91 == 0) or ((x & 77 == 0) <= (x & A != 0))) == 0:\n      ok = False\n  if ok:\n    print(A)\n    break",
