      "text": "for A in range(200, -1, -1):\n  ok = True\n  for x in range(1, 200):\n    for y in range(1, 200):\n      if ((x + y <= 22) or (y <= x - 6) or (y >= A)) == 0:\n        ok = False\n  if ok:\n    print(A)\n    break",
      "originalText": "for A in range(200, -1, -1):\n  ok = True\n  for x in range(1, 200):\n    for y in range(1, 200):\n      if ((x + y <= 22) or (y <= x - 6) or (y >= A)) == 0:\n        ok = False\n  if ok:\n    print(A)\n    break",
