      "text": "P = list(range(117, 158 + 1))\nQ = list(range(129, 180 + 1))\nA = []\n\nfor x in range(0, 300):\n  if ((x in P) <= (((x in Q) and (not (x in A))) <=\n(not (x in P)))) == 0:\n    A.append(x)\n\nprint(max(A) - min(A))",
