      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B = list(range(24, 90 + 1))\nC = list(range(47, 115 + 1))\nA = []\n\nfor x in range(0, 300):\n  if ((x in C) <= (((not (x in A)) and (x in B)) <=\n(not (x in C)))) == 0:\n    A.append(x)\n\nprint(max(A) - min(A))",
      "originalText": "B = list(range(24, 90 + 1))\nC = list(range(47, 115 + 1))\nA = []\n\nfor x in range(0, 300):\n  if ((x in C) <= (((not (x in A)) and (x in B)) <= (not (x in C)))) == 0:\n    A.append(x)\n\nprint(max(A) - min(A))",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
