      "text": "P = {1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11}\nQ = {3, 6, 9, 12}\nA = []\n\nfor x in range(1, 100):\n  if (((x in P) <= (not (x in Q))) or (x in A)) == 0:\n    A.append(x)\n\nprint(sum(A))",
      "originalText": "P = {1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11}\nQ = {3, 6, 9, 12}\nA = []\n\nfor x in range(1, 100):\n  if (((x in P) <= (not (x in Q))) or (x in A)) == 0:\n    A.append(x)\n\nprint(sum(A))",
